  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Eco-friendly Integrated Poultry Project for Increasing Farm Incomes in Vientiane, Laos</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Small-scale  feed warehouse and slaughterhouse construction, Expansion of wholesale and retail sales outlets, Expanding Producer, Cooperatives, Poultry Skills Education, Lao-specialized poultry disease research and development</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The primary goal is to increase the stable income of farmers and organizations engaged in eco-friendly comprehensive poultry farming, addressing the two major challenges faced by Laotian farmers when raising native chickens: the high cost of feed and disease issues&#xac1c;&#xbc1c;&#xb41c; &#xc790;&#xccb4; &#xc0ac;&#xb8cc;&#xc7a5;
&#xcde8;&#xc57d; &#xacc4;&#xce35;(&#xc7a5;&#xc560;&#xc778; &#xc5ec;&#xc131; &#xd611;&#xd68c;) &#xc18c;&#xb4dd; &#xd5a5;&#xc0c1;
